  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 200°C/180°C fan-forced. Slice potato into halves.\n• Place potato halves on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat. Arrange so that each potato is cut-side down.\n• Bake until crisp and tender, 35-45 minutes.\n• Remove from oven, then carefully turn each potato to be cut-side up. Sprinkle with shredded Cheddar cheese.\n• Return to oven to bake until golden, a further 6-8 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the potatoes between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6488022817e7f91161de48e9-92f2cd39.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the potatoes are baking, finely chop brown onion and garlic.\n• Roughly chop celery, then set aside. Grate carrot. Drain and rinse lentils.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6488022817e7f91161de48e9-14685f90.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the potatoes have 10 minutes remaining, heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan, over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion and carrot, tossing, until tender, 4-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6488022817e7f91161de48e9-366a22d9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add garlic, Mumbai spice blend and tomato paste. Cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Stir in lentils, coconut milk, vegetable stock powder and the water. Simmer until thickened, 2-4 minutes.\n• Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6488022817e7f91161de48e9-b516577d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the dhal is simmering, combine a drizzle of the white wine vinegar and olive oil in a medium bowl. Season, then add mixed salad leaves and celery. Toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6488022817e7f91161de48e9-57e08696.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide cheesy jacket potatoes and salad between plates.\n• Spoon dhal over potatoes. Sprinkle with flaked almonds. Tear over mint leaves.\n• Serve with a dollop of plant-based coconut yoghurt. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6488022817e7f91161de48e9-93192f93.jpeg"
    }
  ]
